==Battleground==
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Fishman Cat]] in your lineup, which you should, you can kill the Mooths quickly then spam Fishman and Slime to beat the stage before anything too serious appears.

